Araghchi: New aggression in Persian Gulf will have ‘devastating’ impact on energy markets

Iranian Foreign Minister Abbas Araghchi has warned that any renewed Israeli-instigated military aggression in the Persian Gulf region could have a “devastating impact” on global energy markets.

