Pezeshkian: Iran diligently working to implement Leader’s directive to end war

President Masoud Pezeshkian says Iran is working to implement the directive of Leader of the Islamic Revolution Ayatollah Seyyed Mojtaba Khamenei, to pursue the fulfillment of Tehran’s conditions for ending the US-Israeli-imposed war and terminating the “no war, no peace” situation.

